<title>SRI LANKA: Bank chief new head of Colombo stock exchange.</title>
<headline>Bank chief new head of Colombo stock exchange.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of one of Sri Lanka's private commercial bank has been elected to head the Colombo Stock Exchange, an exchange official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rienzie Wijetilleke, managing director and chief executive of Hatton National Bank Ltd, who is also chairman of brokerage Jardine Fleming HNB Securities (Pvt) ltd, will take over from Ajit Jayaratne next month.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (9451) 434319</p>
